{"i":"2963","t":"Memos, Fingerprints, & Photos Of Nicholai Missiura Micioura","s":"D Files","p":4,"pages":[{"n":0,"en":"D.3. D.2150\nSHANGHAI MUNICIPAL POLICE\nC. & S. I. BRANCH\nNo. S. B. D. 2150\nDate 17 = 3.31.\n\nMarch 17 31\n\nSir,\n\nI have to acknowledge receipt of\nyour letter and enclosures of March 11, 1931,\nand to forward herewith a copy of the original\nrecord of Nicholai Missiura (Kiofourin).\n\n17/3.\n\nI am, Sir,\n\nYour obedient servant,\n\nDeputy Commissioner\n(Crime & Special Branches)\n\nChief Inspector of Police,\nBritish Municipal Council,\nTientsin.","zh":"D.3. D.2150\n上海公共租界工部局警务处\n刑事与特别股\n编号 S. B. D. 2150\n日期 17 = 3.31.\n\n3月17日 31\n\n先生：\n\n兹确认收到阁下1931年3月11日来函及附件，并随函附上尼古拉·米休拉（Nicolai Missiura）（Kiofourin）原始记录副本一份。\n\n17/3.\n\n此致，\n\n阁下之恭顺仆人，\n\n副总监\n（刑事及特别股）\n\n警察总督察，\n天津英租界工部局。"},{"n":1,"en":"TELEGRAPHIC ADDRESS: \"BRITMUPAL\"\nSHANGHAI MUNICIPAL COUNCIL\nC. & S. B. REGS.\nS. B. D. 2150.\nCouncil Offices, 16 - 3 - 31.\nTientsin.\n\n（印：BRITISH MUNICIPAL COUNCIL TIENTSIN）\nPOLICE DEPARTMENT.\n\n11th. March, 1931.\n\nSir,\n\nI beg to forward herewith the Finger Prints and\nphotograph of a Russian named Nicolai Missiura, arrested\nby this Police Office on a charge of theft of a motorcar.\nThe arrested is said to have had previous convictions\nat Shanghai. Therefore I should be very much obliged if\nyou would kindly furnish me with any information you may\nhave regarding this person.\n\nI am, Sir,\nYour obedient Servant.\n\n（签名）\nChief Inspector of Police.\n\nCommissioner of Police.\nI/C C. I. D.\nShanghai Municipal Council.\n\n（左侧手写批注）：\n* Sir,\nFiles 10. 8383,\n& Cr. Reg. files\nH. 2348 & C. 678\nattached.\n（签名）\n16/3.\n\n（底部手写批注）：\nPA\n（签名）\n17/3 Pd","zh":"电报挂号：“BRITMUPAL”\n上海公共租界工部局\n刑事与特别股规章\nS. B. D. 2150.\n工部局办公室，1931年3月16日。\n天津。\n\n（印：天津英租界工部局）\n警务处。\n\n1931年3月11日。\n\n先生：\n\n兹随函附上一名名为尼古拉·米休拉（Nicolai Missiura）的俄国人的指纹及照片，此人系由本警局以盗窃汽车罪名逮捕。据称该被捕者此前在上海曾有定罪记录。因此，如蒙阁下提供有关此人之任何资料，本人将不胜感激。\n\n此致，\n\n阁下之恭顺仆人。\n\n（签名）\n警察总督察。\n\n警务处处长。\n兼管刑事侦缉处\n上海